{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanCommand"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import AppEvents","import TrackingPlans","","@main","struct AppTrackingPlan: TrackingPlanCommand {","    static var trackingPlan: TrackingPlan {","        get throws(TrackingPlanError) { try TrackingPlan() }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Run it with the directory to write the plan’s files to (","type":"text"},{"code":"swift run AppTrackingPlan TrackingPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), or let the ","type":"text"},{"code":"export-tracking-plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" command plugin build and run it:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"swift package --allow-writing-to-package-directory export-tracking-plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Run it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" and the directory of the committed plan ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift run AppTrackingPlan check TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":"), or let the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check-tracking-plan"},{"type":"text","text":" command plugin do so ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift package check-tracking-plan"},{"type":"text","text":"), to fail when the events no longer match that plan, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" compares them. With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--breaking-only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"ty